/*
 * COBI — Team & RACI tab  (window.CPL_RACI_TAB)
 *
 * Manage WHO is Responsible / Accountable / Consulted / Informed for each
 * workplan Activity and Project, plus the team-member registry that feeds both
 * RACI assignment and the update nudges.
 *
 * STATIC asset — NOT regenerated by excel_to_dashboard.py. Lazy-loaded on first
 * #raci open. Injects its own var(--token) CSS (no Rule-4 mirror needed; only
 * the nav button + pane + boot are mirrored in both HTMLs).
 *
 * Data: public reads of Supabase team_members + item_raci (anon key, same as the
 * other tabs); writes gated by the shared magic-link reviewer session (cpl_sb)
 * + is_allowed_reviewer(). Items come from window.CPL_DATA (projects) + the 4
 * canonical Activities.
 */
